---
title: Log in to Taskip Workspace
description: >-
  Log in to your Taskip workspace to manage clients, projects, billing, and
  workflows. Follow simple steps to sign in and easily switch between multiple
  workspaces.
sidebar:
  order: 1
---
Accessing your Taskip workspace is quick and easy. Once your account is created, you can log in anytime to manage clients, projects, billing, and your entire agency workflow.

Follow the steps below to sign in.

### **Step 1: Go to the Login Page**

Open your browser and visit - [https://taskip.net/login](https://taskip.net/login)

If your agency uses a&nbsp;custom domain, log in directly through your custom URL.

Example -`https://youragency.taskip.net`

### **Step 2: Enter Your Email and Password**

You will see two input fields:

- Email Address
- Password

Enter the credentials you used during account creation.

### **Step 3: Click “Log In”**

After entering your details, click the&nbsp;Log In&nbsp;button.\
If your credentials are correct, you will be redirected to your Taskip Dashboard.

## **If You Manage Multiple Workspaces**

Taskip allows you to be part of more than one workspace.

After logging in:

1. Click your&nbsp;profile icon&nbsp;(top-right)
1. Select&nbsp;Switch Workspace
1. Choose the workspace you want to access

Each workspace has its own settings, clients, billing, and projects.
